# Quality Gate

Follow `AGENTS.md` and the selected workflow in `docs/ai-development-flow.md`.
Use `docs/code-quality.md` for supported checks and automation, and
`docs/code-quality-metrics.md` for the local-only Biome metrics flow.

Run focused regression tests and relevant lint, metrics, type, build, and browser
checks. Report real results and blockers. Never invent passing results, weaken
gates, raise thresholds, add suppressions, or expand exclusions to hide failures.
